@startuml
!theme plain
autonumber

actor "Petugas Klinik" as Admin
participant "Web Admin" as Web
participant "Laravel Backend API" as API
database "MySQL (dsh_db)" as DB
participant "Outbox Dispatcher" as Outbox
participant "Temporal Server" as TempServer
participant "Temporal Worker" as Worker

Admin -> Web : Ubah Jam Pengingat atau Periode Aktivitas
Web -> API : PUT /api/admin/activity-plans/{id}
activate API

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
API -> DB : UPDATE activity_plans
API -> DB : Hapus jadwal masa depan yang belum dilaporkan
API -> DB : GENERATE ulang activity_schedules baru
API -> DB : INSERT INTO outbox_events (ActivityPlanUpdated, status: 'pending')
API -> DB : COMMIT TRANSACTION
API --> Web : 200 OK
deactivate API

== Pengiriman Signal Perubahan ke Temporal ==
Outbox -> DB : SELECT * FROM outbox_events WHERE status = 'pending'
DB --> Outbox : Return Event 'ActivityPlanUpdated'

Outbox -> TempServer : SignalWorkflowExecution\n(WorkflowID: activity-plan-{id}, Signal: update-plan-signal)
TempServer --> Outbox : Signal Delivered
Outbox -> DB : UPDATE outbox_events SET status = 'published'

TempServer -> Worker : Deliver Signal into workflow
Worker -> Worker : updateSelector triggered!\nBatalkan timer jadwal lama secara presisi!\nGanti daftar jadwal dengan jadwal baru!\nSet ulang Durable Timer sesuai jam pengingat baru.
@enduml
